---

## Quick Start

```bash
npx evc-spark-mcp
```

That's it. No API key needed.

---

## Setup

### Claude Code

```bash
claude mcp add spark -- npx -y evc-spark-mcp
```

### Claude Desktop

Add to `claude_desktop_config.json`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "spark": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "evc-spark-mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

